# Simulation state. Each pickle carries the per-shot correctness and stop-time
# matrices so the speedup analysis and the bootstrap can be redone without
# re-simulating, which makes them 8-11 MB each -- ~600 MB for the full
# experiment x detector matrix. Regenerate with `run`; the committed figures,
# CSVs and summaries under results/ are derived from them.
*.pkl
